{"ID":"20231122150544-7bdobw4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20231122150544-7bdobw4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122150544-7bdobw4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122150600-96pesly\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122151345-kww3roa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122151235-cnrzkbs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"阳明脉解篇","type":"doc","updated":"20231122151402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231122150600-96pesly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150600-96pesly","updated":"20231122150600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本篇要点："}]},{"ID":"20231122150600-hzxkuyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150600-hzxkuyf","updated":"20231122150600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本篇是解释阳明经脉的实热症状和病理变化，可与《灵枢.经脉篇》参看。"}]},{"ID":"20231122150602-vw79ww6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150602-vw79ww6"}},{"ID":"20231122150613-cp9ok8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-cp9ok8x","updated":"20231122150654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问曰：足阳明之脉病，恶人与火，闻木音则惕然而惊，钟鼓不为动，闻木音而惊何也？愿闻其故。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-l6r9fiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-l6r9fiv","updated":"20231122150618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道：足阳明的经脉发生病变，恶见人与火，听到木器响动的声音就受惊，但听到敲打钟鼓的声音却不为惊动。为什麽听到木音就惊惕？我希望听听其中道理。"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-t4r64tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-t4r64tr","updated":"20231122150657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯对曰：阳明者，胃脉也，胃者土也，故闻木音而惊者，土恶木也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-idtm75w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-idtm75w","updated":"20231122150621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：足阳明是胃的经脉，属土。所以听到木音而惊惕，是因为土恶木克的缘故。"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-axptem5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-axptem5","updated":"20231122150703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：善。其恶火何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-vjslbbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-vjslbbk","updated":"20231122150622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：好！那麽恶火是为什麽呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-7mjf8x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-7mjf8x2","updated":"20231122150704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：阳明主肉，其脉血气盛，邪客之则热，热甚则恶火。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-ot2vpgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-ot2vpgn","updated":"20231122150625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：足阳明经主肌肉，其经脉多血多气，外邪侵袭则发热，热甚则所以恶火。"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-bakzw41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-bakzw41","updated":"20231122150706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：其恶人何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-cwjgo7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-cwjgo7x","updated":"20231122150939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：讨厌看到人是何道理？"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-8zbt63p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-8zbt63p","updated":"20231122150708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：阳明厥则喘而惋，惋则恶人。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-eozkxt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-eozkxt4","updated":"20231122150629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：足阳明经气上逆，则呼吸喘促，心中郁闷，所以不喜欢见人。"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-fin6sux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-fin6sux","updated":"20231122150709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：或喘而死者，或喘而生者，何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-l2k7d0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-l2k7d0h","updated":"20231122150630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：有的阳明厥逆喘促而死，有的虽喘促而不死，这是为什麽呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-ex213lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-ex213lc","updated":"20231122150712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：厥逆连脏则死，连经则生。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-w1kf6az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-w1kf6az","updated":"20231122151139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：经气厥逆若累及于内脏（连到脏），则病深重而死；若仅连及外在的经脉，则病轻浅可生。"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-oycwssy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-oycwssy","updated":"20231122150714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：善。病甚则弃衣而走，登高而歌，或至不食数日，逾垣上屋，所上之处，皆非其素所能也，病反能者何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-hth0ark","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-hth0ark","updated":"20231122150634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：好！有的阳明病重之时，病人把衣服脱掉乱跑乱跳，登上高处狂叫唱歌，或者数日不进饮食，并能够越墙上屋，而所登上之处，都是其平素所不能的，有了病反能够上去，这是什麽原因？"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-a2wxrq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-a2wxrq6","updated":"20231122150716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：四肢者诸阳之本也。阳盛则四肢实，实则能登高也。帝曰：其弃衣而走者何也？岐伯曰：热盛于身，故弃衣欲走也。帝曰：其妄言骂詈，不避亲疏而歌者何也？岐伯曰：阳盛则使人妄言骂詈，不避亲疏而欲食，不欲食故妄走也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122150613-prixscy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122150613-prixscy","updated":"20231122150637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：四肢是阳气的根本。阳气盛则四肢充实，所以能够登高。黄帝道：其不穿衣服而到处乱跑。黄帝道：其胡言乱语骂人，不避亲疏而随便唱歌，是什麽道理？岐伯说：阳热亢盛而扰动心神，故使其神志失常，胡言乱语，斥骂别人，不避亲疏，并且不知道吃饭，所以便到处乱跑。"}]},{"ID":"20231122151235-cnrzkbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122151235-cnrzkbs"}},{"ID":"20231122151345-kww3roa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122151345-kww3roa","updated":"20231122151402"}}]}